    "caption": "🤩 For the first time in Kazakhstan! \n\n🌟 At Digital Bridge 2023 was Tim Draper’s keynote speech about how to become a startup hero.\n\n🎥 Then reality show “Meet the Drapers” has recorded an episode for reality’s season 7.\n\n🔥 “Meet the Drapers” is a reality show in which technology startups from around the world are selected to pitch their project to Tim Draper and his family.\n\n🚀 At the season finale, one project from Kazakhstan will have a chance to win $1 million in investment from Draper’s private foundation. \n\n❤️ We want to thank @timdraper @meetthedrapers for visiting us at this Digital Bridge 2023! Waiting for you next times too!",
